<section class="innovation">
  <div class="innovation__container">
    <div class="innovation__header">
      <p class="section_numbering">02</p>
      <h2 class="innovation__title">The
        <em>Innovation</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="innovation__grid">
      <div class="innovation-card innovation-card--saffrux">
        <div class="innovation-card__row">
          <div class="innovation-card__media">
            <img src="{{ 'saffruxsj.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Saffron strands in a clear liquid"
              class="innovation-card__image" width="400" height="400">
          </div>
          <div class="innovation-card__intro">
            <h3 class="innovation-card__heading">Saffrux Brightening Engine™</h3>
            <p class="innovation-card__description">The radiance of
              <em>saffron</em>, redefined by
              <em>science</em>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="innovation-card__row">
          <div class="innovation-card__details">
            <p>This next-generation brightening system harnesses the rare potency of GI-tagged Kashmiri Mongra Saffron,
              revered in Ayurveda for its ability to even out skin tone, fade pigmentation, and enhance natural glow.
            </p>
            <p>But saffron alone isn’t enough it needs a delivery system that ensures deeper penetration and sustained
              action. That’s where modern science steps in.</p>
            <p>
              <strong>Saffrux Brightening Engine™</strong>
              synergizes:
            </p>
            <ul class="innovation-card__list">
              <li>
                <span>• Stabilized Vitamin C (Ethyl Ascorbic Acid)</span>
                – to enhance brightness and reduce oxidative damage.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>• Niacinamide</span>
                – to refine skin texture, minimize pores, and strengthen the skin barrier.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>• Licorice & Turmeric Extracts</span>
                – to inhibit melanin overproduction naturally.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="innovation-card__tagline">
            <p class="innovation-card__tagline-text">It’s
              <em>brightness</em>, <br> done
              <em>consciously</em>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="innovation-card innovation-card--biome">
        <div class="innovation-card__row">
          <div class="innovation-card__intro">
            <h3 class="innovation-card__heading">BarrierBiome Complex™</h3>
            <p class="innovation-card__description">The new frontier of
              <em>barrier care.</em>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="innovation-card__media">
            <img src="{{ 'bbcomp.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Microscopic view of skin barrier cells"
              class="innovation-card__image" width="400" height="400">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="innovation-card__row">
          <div class="innovation-card__tagline">
            <p>BarrierBiome Complex™ doesn’t just repair —</p>
            <p class="innovation-card__tagline-text">It teaches your skin <br> to
              <em>defend itself.</em>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="innovation-card__details">
            <p>Modern skin is exposed to constant stress - pollution, UV, actives, and lifestyle.</p>
            <p>BarrierBiome Complex™ was created to repair what the world takes away. But saffron alone isn’t enough it
              needs a delivery system that ensures deeper penetration and sustained action. That’s where modern science
              steps in.</p>
            <p>It’s a bio-repair network designed to fortify your skin’s microbiome and restore its natural defense.</p>
            <p>The result:
              <strong>stronger</strong>,
              <strong>calmer</strong>,
              <strong>visibly healthier</strong>
              skin that feels balanced from within.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="innovation__footer">
      <h3 class="innovation__footer-title">Together, They Create
        <em>Balance</em>…
      </h3>
      <div class="innovation__footer-text">
        <p>While
          <span>Saffrux Brightening Engine™</span>
          illuminates and evens tone,
          <span>BarrierBiome Complex™</span>
          restores and protects, achieving what we call
        </p>
        <p class="innovation__footer-conclusion">Conscious Radiance: brightness that’s born from health, not harshness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .innovation {
    --color-primary-text: #63001f;
    --color-body-text: #444;
    --font-serif: "Instrument Serif"
      , serif;
    --background-noise: url('{{ "noise.png" | asset_url }}');
    --background-main: #FAF0E6;
    --background-saffrux: #FDD9BE;
    --background-biome: #E6F0E9;
    --border-radius-card: 16px;
    --grid-gap: 1rem;

    background: var(--background-main) var(--background-noise);
    background-size: 150px 150px;
    padding: 4rem 1rem;
  }

  .innovation__container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .innovation__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .innovation__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: var(--color-primary-text);
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 200;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation__grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .innovation-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--grid-gap);
  }

  .innovation-card__row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--grid-gap);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .innovation-card--saffrux {
    --card-background: var(--background-saffrux);
  }

  .innovation-card--biome {
    --card-background: var(--background-biome);
  }

  .innovation-card__media {
    width: 400px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 400px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .innovation-card__image {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .innovation-card__intro,
  .innovation-card__details,
  .innovation-card__tagline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-card);
    background: var(--card-background) var(--background-noise);
    background-size: 150px 150px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .innovation-card__intro {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .innovation-card__heading {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--color-body-text);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation-card__description {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--color-primary-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation-card__details {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-body-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .innovation-card__details p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation-card__list {
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .innovation-card__list span {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .innovation-card__tagline {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-primary-text);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .innovation-card__tagline p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .innovation-card__tagline-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 48px !important;
    font-weight: 200;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .innovation__footer {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .innovation__footer-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--color-primary-text);
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 200;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation__footer-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .innovation__footer-text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-body-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .innovation__footer-text span {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .innovation__footer-conclusion {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {

    .innovation {
      padding: 2rem 0.5rem;
    }

    .innovation__container {
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .innovation__title {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .innovation-card__heading {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .innovation-card {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .innovation-card__row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .innovation-card__media {
      width: 100%;
      height: 400px;
    }

    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:first-child {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:first-child .innovation-card__media {
      order: 1;
    }

    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:first-child .innovation-card__intro {
      order: 2;
    }

    /* Saffron Brightening Engine - Second Row */
    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:last-child {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:last-child .innovation-card__details {
      order: 1;
    }

    .innovation-card--saffrux .innovation-card__row:last-child .innovation-card__tagline {
      order: 2;
    }

    /* BarrierBiome Complex - First Row */
    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:first-child {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:first-child .innovation-card__media {
      order: 1;
    }

    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:first-child .innovation-card__intro {
      order: 2;
    }

    /* BarrierBiome Complex - Second Row */
    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:last-child {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:last-child .innovation-card__details {
      order: 1;
    }

    .innovation-card--biome .innovation-card__row:last-child .innovation-card__tagline {
      order: 2;
    }

    .innovation-card__intro,
    .innovation-card__details,
    .innovation-card__tagline {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .innovation-card__tagline {
      padding: 3rem;

      p {
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    }

    .innovation-card__description {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .innovation-card__tagline-text {
      font-size: 40px !important;
    }

    .innovation-card__details {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .innovation__footer {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .innovation__footer-title {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .innovation__footer-text p {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .innovation__footer-conclusion {
      font-size: 14px !important;
      line-height: 1.7 !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 360px) {

    .innovation-card__tagline p {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .innovation-card__tagline-text {
      font-size: 38px !important;
    }

    .promise-card__text {
      font-size: 11px !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
